        <mxCell id="jKF1hYW0deIjBeX3VYYe-43" connectable="0" parent="jKF1hYW0deIjBeX3VYYe-42" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=default;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;drpc.MethodPoolCreate&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;drpc.MethodPoolDestroy&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;drpc.MethodPoolEvict&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;drpc.MethodPool*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.0823" y="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-66" y="18" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jKF1hYW0deIjBeX3VYYe-46" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ol style=&quot;line-height: 200%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;goals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;replace (add/remove) daos_mgmt replicas dynamically;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;keep daos_server simple and stable (so daos_engines are stable)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;daos_mgmt and daos_server/mgmtAgent will have many grpc interfaces in common;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;however, daos_mgmt does not merely forward the requests;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;daos_mgmt has its own functionality;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;take PoolCreate for example, daos_mgmt creates PoolService struct in sysdb;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;daos_server/mgmtAgent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;added for bridging daos_mgmt and daos_engine;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;pass drpc requests to daos_engine, because daos_mgmt cannot call svc.harness.CallDrpc() any more!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;all mgmtAgent on different hosts are functionally identical; because daos_engines are functionally identical for mgmt, thanks to CaRT!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;ctlSvc, such as StorageFormat, are kept unchanged&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;controls hardware resources on each server&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;dmg will fanout requests to each target daos_server;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="760" x="-580" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
